        "biography": "Lori McCoy-Bell\u00a0is an American\u00a0hairstylist. She won a\u00a0Primetime Emmy Award\u00a0in the category\u00a0Outstanding Hairstyling For A Single-Camera Series\u00a0for her work on the television program\u00a0Westworld.\u00a0She also won a\u00a0British Academy Film Award\u00a0for the film\u00a0American Hustle.\n\nMcCoy-Bell has been a longtime collaborator with film director\u00a0David O. Russell.\u00a0In 2024, she was nominated for an\u00a0Academy Award\u00a0in the category\u00a0of Best Makeup and Hairstyling\u00a0for the film\u00a0Maestro. She shared her nomination with\u00a0Kazu Hiro\u00a0and\u00a0Kay Georgiou.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Lori McCoy-Bell, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.",
